        "text": "(2) 当 $f(t)=u(t)$ 时的空状态 $y_{2s}(t)=9(t)=\\int_{-10}^{10}h(\\tau)d\\tau$ 故 $y_{2s}(t)=\\int_{-10}^{t}(3e^{-\\tau}-6e^{-2\\tau})u(\\tau)d\\tau+\\int_{-10}^{t}\\sqrt{(\\tau)}d\\tau$ $=\\int_{0}^{t}(3e^{-\\tau}-6e^{-2\\tau})d\\tau\\cdot u(t)+u(t)$ $=\\left[-3e^{-\\tau}+3e^{-2\\tau}\\right]_{0}^{t}\\cdot u(t)+u(t)$ $=\\left[-3e^{-t}+3e^{-2t}+3-3\\right]u(t)+u(t)$ $=(-3e^{-t}+3e^{-2t}+1)u(t)$ $y_{2i}(t)=y(t)-y_{x}(t)=(2e^{-t}-e^{-2t})u(t)$",
