    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} {h ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 h ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 h (t) = - \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) - 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t)} \\\\ {h (t) = A e ^ {- t} + B e ^ {- 2 t}} \\\\ {\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {h ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\delta (t) + c \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow a = - 1} \\\\ {h ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta (t) + b \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow b + 3 a = - 6 \\Rightarrow b = - 3 \\Rightarrow h (v +)} \\\\ {h (t) = a \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow h (v +) = h (v -) + a = - 1} \\end{array} \\right.} \\\\ {h (v +) = A + B = - 1 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {A = - 5} \\\\ {B = 4} \\end{array} \\right.} \\\\ {h ^ {\\prime} (v +) = - A - 2 B = - 3 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad B = 4} \\\\ {h (t) = (- 5 e ^ {- t} + 4 e ^ {- 2 t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
