        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d y (t)}{d t} + 1 0 y (t) = - x (t) + \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} x (\\tau) z (t - \\tau) d t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            317,
