    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nz (t) = e ^ {- t} u (t) + 3 \\delta (t), \\text {   求:   系统函数   } H (s) \\text {   和单位冲激相应   } h (t) 。   h (t) + 1 0 h (t) = - \\delta (t) + \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (\\tau) z (t - \\tau) d t = - \\delta (t) + z (t) = e ^ {- t} u (t) + 2 \\delta (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
