        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {h (t) = A e ^ {- t} + (\\mathrm{而对}) ^ {2}} \\\\ & {t > 0 \\mathrm{时自由项为} e ^ {- t} \\mathrm{则} h _ {p} (t) = B e ^ {- t}} \\\\ & {- B e ^ {- t} + 1 0 B e ^ {- t} = e ^ {- t} \\Rightarrow B = \\frac {1}{9} \\Rightarrow h _ {p} (t) = \\frac {1}{9} e ^ {- t}} \\\\ & {\\therefore h (t) = A e ^ {- 1 0 t} + \\frac {1}{9} e ^ {- t}} \\\\ & {\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {h ^ {\\prime} (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow a = 2} \\\\ {h (t) = a \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow h (0 + 1) = h (0 - 1) = 2} \\\\ {h (0 + 1) = A + \\frac {1}{9} = 2} & {\\Rightarrow A = \\frac {1 7}{9}} \\end{array} \\right.} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow h (t) = (\\frac {1 7}{9} e ^ {- 1 0 t} + \\frac {1}{9} e ^ {- t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
