    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、【2024厦门大学2】某一线性时不变系统，初始状态恒定，其微分方程如下：",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            810,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + a _ {0} y ^ {\\prime} (t) + a _ {1} y (t) = b _ {0} x ^ {\\prime} (t) + b _ {1} x (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            326,
            131,
            667,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知当输入为 $f_{1}(t)=e^{-2t}u(t)$ 时，系统的全响应为 $(e^{-t}+2e^{-2t}-e^{-4t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            155,
            773,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "当输入为 $f_{2}(t)=\\delta(t)-2e^{-2t}u(t)$ 时，系统的全响应为 $(3e^{-t}-4e^{-2t}+4e^{-4t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            181,
            811,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 求系数 $a_{0}$ 和 $a_{1}$ 的值;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            207,
            388,
            224
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 求系统的零输入响应 $y_{zi}(t)$ 和冲激响应 $h(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            233,
            569,
            250
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 求 $b_{0}$ 和 $b_{1}$ 的值。",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            257,
            357,
            275
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 求 $b_0$ 和 $b_1$ 的值。\n解 (1) 由 $f_1(t) = e^{-\\alpha} u(t)$ 对应完全响应的形式可知。\n-1 和 -4 为余分特征根\n即 $(\\alpha + 1)(\\alpha + 4) = \\alpha^2 + 5\\alpha + 4$ 故 $a_0 = 5, a_1 = 4$ 设系统恒定初始状态下零输入响应为 $\\beta_{1}$",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            264,
            697,
            401
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "",
        "bbox": [
            208,
            400,
            680,
            444
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$f(t)=e^{-2t}$ (1) 对应更状态为 $y_{2}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            438,
            564,
            482
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) = [ e ^ {- 2 t} u + t ] = - 2 e ^ {- 2 t} u (t) + \\delta (t) = f _ {2} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            225,
            466,
            630,
            515
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {x} ^ {\\prime} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            791,
            444,
            850,
            478
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {i} (t) + y _ {2 s} (t) = \\left(e ^ {- t} + 2 e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 4 t}\\right) (u t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            243,
            503,
            663,
            554
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 i} (t) + y _ {x i} (t) = (3 e ^ {- t} - 4 e ^ {- x t} + 4 e ^ {- (t)} u (t))\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            243,
            541,
            653,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②-①得 $y_{x}(t)-y_{x}(t)=(2e^{-t}-6e^{-2t}+5e^{-4t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            206,
            572,
            764,
            628
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 s h} (t) = A e ^ {t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            272,
            627,
            438,
            657
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {x p} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            657,
            411,
            692
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n2 e ^ {- t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            485,
            647,
            539,
            676
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n- 6 e ^ {- 2 t} \\cdot 5 e ^ {- 4 t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            569,
            638,
            727,
            672
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nB _ {2} e ^ {- x}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            574,
            675,
            653,
            707
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\Rightarrow B _ {1} e ^ {- t} - B _ {2} e ^ {- t}} \\\\ & {- B _ {1} e ^ {- t} - B _ {1} e ^ {- t} = 2 e ^ {- t} \\Rightarrow B _ {1} = - 1} \\\\ & {- 2 B _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} - B _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} = - 6 e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow B _ {2} = 2} \\\\ & {- 4 B _ {3} e ^ {- 4 t} - B _ {3} e ^ {- 4 t} = 5 e ^ {- 4 t} \\Rightarrow B _ {3} = - 1} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow y _ {x, t} (t) = A e ^ {t} - e ^ {- t} + 2 e ^ {- x} - e ^ {- 4 t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            263,
            691,
            650,
            859
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "无烟度 $y_{x}(14) = A - 1 + 2 - 1 = 0 \\Rightarrow A = 0$",
        "bbox": [
            282,
