        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {1 0 9 5 8 4 1 8 7 8} & {\\Rightarrow y _ {2 i} (t) = 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\quad f _ {2 i} (t) \\mathrm{对应的要状态响应} = h (t) - 2 y _ {x} (t) = y _ {2 s} ^ {\\prime} (t)} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow h (t) = y _ {x s} ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y _ {2 s} (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad = [ e ^ {- t} - 4 e ^ {- 2 t} + 4 e ^ {- 4 t} ] u (t) + 2 [ - e ^ {- t} + 2 e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 4 t} ] u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad = (- e ^ {- t} + 2 e ^ {- 4 t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
