    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {b _ {0} x ^ {\\prime} (t) + b _ {1} x (t)} & {= b _ {0} \\left[ - 2 e ^ {- 2 t} (u (t) + d ^ {\\prime} (t)) + b _ {1} \\cdot e ^ {- 2 t} (u (t) \\right.} \\\\ & {= (- 2 b _ {0} + b _ {1}) e ^ {- 2 t} (u (t) + b _ {0} d ^ {\\prime} (t))} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
