        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {t > 0 \\mathrm{时}} & {(- 2 b _ {0} + b _ {1}) e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {2 \\mathrm{sp}} (t) = C e ^ {- 2 t}} \\\\ & {4 C e ^ {- 2 t} - 1 0 C e ^ {- 2 t} + 4 C e ^ {- 2 t} = (- 2 b _ {0} + b _ {1}) e ^ {- 2 t}} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow - 2 c = - 2 b _ {0} + b _ {1}} \\\\ & {\\mathrm{其中} c = 2 \\Rightarrow \\sqrt {- 2 b _ {0} + b _ {1}} = - 4} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
