    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y _ {2 s} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = b _ {0} \\\\ y _ {2 s} ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y _ {2 s} ^ {\\prime} (u + 1) = b _ {0} \\\\ y _ {2 s} (t) = a t \\Delta u (t) \\\\ y _ {2 s} ^ {\\prime} (u + 1) = 1 = b _ {0} \\\\ \\therefore b _ {1} = - 4 + 2 = - 2 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
